Construct Bondi initial data with
	  coord type = 4
	  Gamma = 2.0
	  kappa = 1.0
	  a_inf = 1.e-2
around a black hole with
       mass = 1.0
and centered on
	 x = 0.0
	 y = 0.0
	 z = 0.0

NOTE: coord type 1 corresponds to normal Schwarzschild,
      coord type 2 corresponds to isotropic Schwarzschild,
      coord type 3 corresponds to Ken's trumpets, and
      coord type 4 corresponds to maximal trumpets.
